# eslint-snapshot-rule-tester format: v1


Test: flowchart-no-ignored-text >> invalid >>> docs/rules/flowchart-no-ignored-text.md incorrect 1
Filename: flowchart-no-ignored-text-incorrect-1.mmd

Code:
  1 | flowchart LR
  2 |   subgraph S
  3 |     A-->B; direction TB
    |     ^~~~~~ [1]
  4 |   end
  5 |

[1] mermaid.js reads this line as a `direction` statement and drops this text.
    Suggestions:
      - Split the line at the `;`: mermaid.js then reads the text as statements, and the direction as a direction statement.
        Output:
          1 | flowchart LR
          2 |   subgraph S
          3 |     A-->B;
          4 |     direction TB
          5 |   end
          6 |
---


